      "especie": "Demon",
      "clase": "Brujo (Warlock)",
      "subclase": "Fiend Patron",
      "debut_sesion": 1,
      "hitos_acumulados": [
        "Sesión #1: Attended the wake, drank heavily with the guests, and attempted to make light of the grim situation.",
        "Sesión #2: Stood by Wicander amidst the bullying of her fiendish sisters and accompanied him into the depths beneath Via Aurora to witness the Prismatic Return.",
        "Sesión #3: Tyranny revealed House Halovar's lethal intentions to Wicander and helped extract Teor from the basement pentagram.",
        "Sesión #6: Sufrió la tentación de su herencia demoníaca, confesó su hurto y apoyó al grupo con magia de fuego en el combate."
      ],
      "aliases": []
