      "hitos_acumulados": [
        "Sesión #1: Survived a brutal attack by the Crow Keepers and was rescued from the flophouse grate by the party.",
        "Sesión #2: Mourned over Thiazi's corpse, defended her partnership with Thiazi to Vaelis, and led Cadogan and Octus into the Crow Keepers' tavern ambush.",
        "Sesión #3: Thimble survived the Crow Keepers ambush by casting Faerie Fire on Solomon and secured vital intelligence regarding Casimir's escape to Gormelay.",
        "Sesión #6: Recibió un arma mágica, lideró la exploración de la glade y destruyó el árbol necrótico con fuego."
      ],
      "aliases": []
