      "debut_sesion": 1,
      "hitos_acumulados": [
        "Sesión #1: Attended the wake in his shifting mask and used his high religion check to spot a shadow following Sir Julian.",
        "Sesión #2: Deciphered the morbid origins of the Coffin of Ol'Balad and conducted arcane research at the Arcanum's Loywing.",
        "Sesión #3: Bolaire analyzed the mysterious lead paint crates delivered from Thiazi's flophouse, detecting an unsettling aura of ancient conjuration magic.",
        "Sesión #4: Confesó su origen mítico como reliquia asesina de dioses y colaboró en el ritual de extracción de la Piedra en la hacienda Loy.",
        "Sesión #5: He survived an ambush by Obris Drym, assumed Obris's identity, and confessed to Hal and Murray that he is a sentient god-killing mask."
      ],
      "aliases": [
        "Bolaire"
      ]
    },
    {
      "personaje": "Sir Julien Davinos",
