      "debut_sesion": 1,
      "hitos_acumulados": [
        "Sesión #1: Attended the wake with Lady Eranessa, paid respects to the body, and was followed by a mysterious magical shadow.",
        "Sesión #2: Stood guard over Lady Eranessa, clashed verbally with his domineering father, and was tasked with capturing the fugitive Taconis heir.",
        "Sesión #3: Sir Julian apprehended Octus Taconis for questioning at Palazzo DeVino, only to witness his father's sudden murder.",
        "Sesión #4: Luchó enfurecido contra la emboscada Taconis tras la muerte del General Raymond, cubriendo la retirada de Lady Eranessa.",
        "Sesión #5: He fought Primus Taconis in a blind rage after his father's murder, landed a critical blow, and escaped to the Loy Estate."
      ],
      "aliases": [
        "Sir Julian DeVino",
        "Sir Julien",
        "Julian DeVino"
      ]
    },
    {
      "personaje": "Murray Mag'nesson",
      "jugador": "Marisha Ray",
      "especie": "Dwarf",
      "clase": "Mago (Wizard)",
      "subclase": "Diviner",
      "debut_sesion": 1,
      "hitos_acumulados": [
        "Sesión #1: Attended the wake, networked with fellow arcanists, and provided lore on the Stone of Nightsong.",
        "Sesión #2: Assisted Bolaire in analyzing the Coffin of Ol'Balad and stood by her dean as political corruption seized the Pentevral.",
        "Sesión #3: Murray stood up to Lord Primus Taconis at the Pentevral before seeking out Azune to report the political corruption.",
        "Sesión #4: Realizó una intervención mágica decisiva usando su 20 natural de Portent para reconstruir las vísceras de Octus y devolverlo a la vida.",
        "Sesión #5: She read Thiazi's letter, confronted Bolaire, and used her powerful Portent magic to perform a flawless extraction that saved Octus's life."
      ],
      "aliases": [
        "Murray Magneson",
        "Murray"
      ]
    },
    {
