      "jugador": "Ashley Johnson",
      "especie": "Elf (drow)",
      "clase": "Paladín (Paladin)",
      "subclase": "Oath of Vengeance",
      "debut_sesion": 1,
      "hitos_acumulados": [
        "Sesión #1: Arrived at the wake demanding the return of the stolen Stone of Nightsong on behalf of her order.",
        "Sesión #2: Conversed privately with Thimble to build mutual understanding regarding the Stone of Nightsong and kept night watch over Hal's house.",
        "Sesión #3: Vaelas turned the tide of the Watchtower tavern ambush with devastating radiant attacks and detected an army of specters surrounding Palazzo DeVino.",
        "Sesión #4: Destruyó entidades espectrales con su Censor Whip y Smite radiante durante la evacuación del palacio.",
        "Sesión #5: She fought the ghouls at Palazzo DeVino, blasted Primus with a Guiding Bolt, and secured Raymond's gauntlet before escaping.",
        "Sesión #6: Experimentó un trance sobre su pasado en Solandria y compartió un momento de quietud nocturna con Octus."
      ],
