      "hitos_acumulados": [
        "Sesión #1: Disguised himself to blend in and successfully bypassed the magical lock at Thiazi's secret flophouse.",
        "Sesión #2: Used his familiar Pin to spy on Vaelis, donned a magical disguise as Cadogan, and joined Thimble at the Watchtower tavern.",
        "Sesión #3: Octus aided in the tavern combat, was escorted to Palazzo DeVino by Julian, and came face-to-face with his undead brother Thrand.",
        "Sesión #4: Sufrió muerte instantánea a manos de su hermano Aetheryn y fue resucitado en una forma paradójica sin latido cardíaco.",
        "Sesión #5: He was killed by Aetheryn Taconis, navigated limbo, and was resurrected without a heartbeat, bearing visions of an undead army.",
