      "chronicle_markdown": "### 🎭 Adventuring Company (Detected Protagonists)\n\n| Character | Player / Role | Class / Species | Session Role |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| **Halendiel 'Hal' Fang** | Liam O'Brien | Bard / Orc | He read Thiazi's letter with Murray and confronted Bolaire, learning that his long-time friend is actually a sentient god-killing mask. |\n| **Azune Nayar** | Luis Carazo | Fighter / Human | He spent the night mourning at Falcon's Rest, resolved never to forget his fallen allies, and joined Murray to find the survivors. |\n| **Tysha Loy** | Aabria Iyengar | Druid / Orc | She fought bravely at Palazzo DeVino, survived a Circle of Death, and used her spiritual connection to call Octus back from the brink of death. |\n| **Octus Taconis** | Alex Ward | Rogue / Human | He was killed by Aetheryn Taconis, navigated limbo, and was resurrected without a heartbeat, bearing visions of an undead army. |\n| **Murray Magneson** | Marisha Ray | Wizard / Dwarf | She read Thiazi's letter, confronted Bolaire, and used her powerful Portent magic to perform a flawless extraction that saved Octus's life. |\n| **Bolaire** | Taliesin Jaffe | Bard / Human | He survived an ambush by Obris Drym, assumed Obris's identity, and confessed to Hal and Murray that he is a sentient god-killing mask. |\n| **Sir Julian DeVino** | Matthew Mercer | Paladin / Human | He fought Primus Taconis in a blind rage after his father's murder, landed a critical blow, and escaped to the Loy Estate. |\n| **Vaelis** | Ashley Johnson | Paladin / Elf | She fought the ghouls at Palazzo DeVino, blasted Primus with a Guiding Bolt, and secured Raymond's gauntlet before escaping. |\n\n---\n\n\n## 1. Narrative Chronicle & Combat\n### Act I: Scene 1: The Price of Secrets in Pottersfield\nIn the cold, damp streets of Pottersfield, Bolaire walked shrouded in a heavy cloak, carrying a meticulously wrapped package. He entered a hidden, high-class hovel run by Devlin, stepping past drunken reprobates into a private parlor. There, he observed the fiendish tailors Calastro and Rullius Mercenat drugging a young man to harvest his shadow. Bolaire was met by Obris Drym, a shady artifact dealer associated with the Crow Keepers. Obris demanded his payment, but upon opening Bolaire's package, he realized he had been tricked. Enraged, Obris flicked Bolaire's mask, triggering a magical sleep that knocked Bolaire unconscious.\n\nStanding over Bolaire's limp body, Obris pulled off the mask, only to recoil in absolute horror. Beneath the porcelain lay no human face, but dry, decaying, grey flesh and empty, hollow eye sockets. When Bolaire woke up hours later, Obris Drym lay dead on the floor. With chilling precision, Bolaire stripped Obris's clothes, used a glass razor to cut up the corpse, burned the identifiable remains in the hearth, and packed the rest away. Stepping back into the night wearing Obris's clothes and face, Bolaire felt like a completely new person, ready to reclaim his stolen life.\n\n### Act II: Scene 2: The Bloodbath at Palazzo DeVino\nMeanwhile, across the river, absolute chaos erupted at Palazzo DeVino. Lord Primus Taconis brutally assassinated General Raymond DeVino, ripping out his spine. Sir Julian DeVino, consumed by primal fury, sprinted forward, drawing his rapier. His initial strike missed, but utilizing an Action Surge, he drove his blade deep into Primus's chest for 7 piercing damage. Julian attempted a follow-up strike with his Demigauntlet, but it deflected off Primus's magical defenses. Suddenly, undead ghoul enforcers dressed in fine clothing ambushed the parlor, knocking Lady Eranessa Royce to the ground and surrounding Octus Taconis.\n\nOctus, choked and grappled by the ghouls, desperately cast 'Mind Spike' on his brother, Aetheryn Taconis. Aetheryn passed his Wisdom saving throw but still took 4 psychic damage. In retaliation, Aetheryn rolled a Natural 20, brutally plunging his hand into Octus's chest, ripping out his heart, and replacing it with the Stone of Nightsong. Octus collapsed, dead, as Vaelis's familiar, Pin, disintegrated. Tysha Loy rushed up the stairs, smelling blood, and witnessed the horror just as Primus Taconis unleashed a devastating 'Circle of Death'. Both Julian and Tysha made their Constitution saves, taking 21 necrotic damage, while the surrounding commoners and guards were instantly obliterated.\n\n### Act III: Scene 3: Escape and the Limbo Divide\nVaelas blasted Primus Taconis with a radiant 'Guiding Bolt', hitting a 22 and dealing 20 radiant damage due to Primus's vulnerability. Julian seized the opening, rolling a Natural 20 on his attack to deal 12 damage. His high Insight roll (19) revealed that Primus was no god, but a mortal man who could be killed, granting Julian permanent advantage on future attacks against him when at half health or less. Primus, severely wounded, activated a Plane Shift, escaping into the shadows with Aetheryn and Octus's heart. Eranessa Royce cast 'Entangle' to root the remaining ghouls, allowing Julian to use Acrobatics (25) to slip away and use Second Wind to heal 10 HP.\n\nTysha Loy was swarmed by ghouls, taking heavy damage, but survived at 1 HP due to her Orcish Relentless Endurance. Eranessa cast 'Healing Word' on her for 11 HP, allowing Tysha to cast 'Tidal Wave', knocking the ghouls back 10 feet and slamming Julian against the wall. Tysha rushed to Octus's corpse. In limbo, Octus's spirit wandered a dark forest. Tysha's voice echoed, pleading with him to return. Octus rolled an 11 on his Wisdom save with advantage, resisting the dark pull of his father. He reached into his own chest in limbo, grasping the cold Stone of Nightsong. Back in the physical world, Eranessa Royce used 'Tree Stride' to teleport Julian, Tysha, Vaelas (who snatched Raymond's gauntlet), and Octus's body to the safety of the Loy Estate.\n\n### Act IV: Scene 4: The Confession and the Heartless Resurrection\nAt Hal's study, Murray Magneson opened Thiazi's blackmail letter, which revealed that Bolaire was actually a sentient artifact mask forged during the Shapers' War to destroy the goddess Rowan. Bolaire arrived in Obris's clothes and confessed everything to Hal and Murray, explaining that he ran away during the Falconer's Rebellion and considered Hal his only true friend. Meanwhile, Azune Nayar mourned at Falcon's Rest, rolling a Natural 1 on Insight, realizing he could never let go of his memories. Azune and Murray united and headed to the Loy Estate, where they found the battered survivors.\n\nUsing her Portent Natural 20, Murray cast 'Mending' and performed a flawless magical extraction, safely stabilizing the Stone of Nightsong and pulling it from Octus's chest. Miraculously, Octus gasped back to life. He had no heartbeat, his body was cold, and Pin emerged from his chest, but he was awake. Octus spoke of terrifying visions of a Taconis undead army marching through Dvalmar Pass. Julian drew his sword, pointing it at the resurrected Octus in suspicion, but Eranessa Royce stepped between them, declaring that while their houses had fallen, they must stand together against the coming darkness.\n\n## 2. Table Closing, Decisions & Expectations\nThe party successfully escaped the massacre at Palazzo DeVino, though General Raymond DeVino was killed. Octus was resurrected through Murray's Portent magic but is now in an altered, undead-like state. The party obtained General Raymond's magical gauntlet and successfully extracted the Stone of Nightsong. Their immediate plan is to regroup, understand Octus's visions of the Dvalmar Pass, and address the revelation of Bolaire's true identity.\n\n## 3. 🎙️ Script to Open Session #6 (Read Aloud)\nAlright folks, quick recap of where we left off: last session was an absolute rollercoaster of blood, secrets, and literal resurrection. We started with Bolaire getting ambushed, only for his mask to be pulled off, revealing his terrifying, decaying true form before he assumed his attacker's identity. Meanwhile, Palazzo DeVino became a slaughterhouse. Lord Primus Taconis assassinated Julian's father, and in the ensuing chaos, Octus was brutally murdered by his own brother, Aetheryn, who ripped his heart out and replaced it with the Stone of Nightsong.\n\nWe fought like hell to survive. Vaelas blasted Primus with radiant light, Julian landed a massive critical hit, and Tysha barely clung to life using her Orcish endurance before Eranessa Royce teleported the survivors and Octus's corpse to the safety of the Loy Estate. Back at the study, Bolaire confessed to Hal and Murray that he is actually a living weapon from the Shapers' War designed to kill gods, and that Hal is his only real friend.\n\nBut the craziest part? Murray used her Portent magic to perform a perfect extraction of the Stone of Nightsong from Octus's chest. Against all laws of nature, Octus gasped back to life—heartless, cold, but breathing. He warned us of a massive undead army marching through Dvalmar Pass. The session ended with Julian pointing a sword at this resurrected Octus, while Eranessa demanded we unite to face the coming storm. Now, we stand in the ruins of our houses, holding a god-killing stone, with a half-dead rogue at our feet. What do we do next?",
      "raw_transcript": "[00:00:00 -> 00:00:12] La noche en Dolmachiar. Una noche fría y caliente. Los pasos llegan. Una taberna de silla en el\n[00:00:12 -> 00:00:23] fray, en la ciudad de la zona más baja. Un sonido de botellas de glas que se desvanecen en las calles\n[00:00:23 -> 00:00:31] gritos de la locura, luchas que se despegan, música sonora, el ruido de un caballo cercano\n[00:00:31 -> 00:00:36] tiene un coche que se despega por la calle, brillando la luz de la llave,\n[00:00:36 -> 00:00:42] recogiendo sombras largas y largas por las calles de la ciudad.\n[00:00:42 -> 00:00:48] Un signo humilde de una taberna.\n[00:00:49 -> 00:00:50] La playa de los poteros.\n[00:00:52 -> 00:00:56] El símbolo de una granja sin nombre en su signo.\n[00:00:57 -> 00:01:00] Unos pocos reprobados bebidos afuera.\n[00:01:02 -> 00:01:04] ¿En qué estado se encuentra Bolaire?\n[00:01:09 -> 00:01:12] Bolaire se ha cerrado su cabello.\n[00:01:12 -> 00:01:20] El capo cerrado y la cintura abierta para ser tan inconspicuo como alguien que se vea con una mascarilla tan única.\n[00:01:20 -> 00:01:21] Puede ser.\n[00:01:22 -> 00:01:24] Tiene un paquete.\n[00:01:27 -> 00:01:28] De una tamaño reasonable.\n[00:01:30 -> 00:01:33] De papel de maquillaje, unido con una cintura.\n[00:01:36 -> 00:01:38] Claramente bien colocado.\n[00:01:38 -> 00:01:40] juntos.\n[00:01:45 -> 00:01:48] Si no sabía mejor, sería como si alguien\n[00:01:48 -> 00:01:50] había rellenado muy bien un presente de Navidad.\n[00:01:50 -> 00:01:52] Es muy crecido y bien cubierto.\n[00:01:53 -> 00:01:54] Y juntos.\n[00:01:54 -> 00:01:56] Quizás sea un regalo para alguien.\n[00:01:58 -> 00:02:00] Pasas por un barrio tan lejos\n[00:02:00 -> 00:02:03] de la Arcanada\n[00:02:03 -> 00:02:05] que las probabilidades de ser reconocidas\n[00:02:05 -> 00:02:07] en este lugar son casi ninguna.\n[00:02:08 -> 00:02:11] La puerta se abre.\n[00:02:14 -> 00:02:17] Los robadores, los criminales,\n[00:02:17 -> 00:02:20] pocos hombres bajo la luz de la campana,\n[00:02:20 -> 00:02:22] hablando en tonos desagradables.\n[00:02:24 -> 00:02:27] El barman se levanta para percibirte.\n[00:02:28 -> 00:02:30] Y con ese contacto de ojo,\n[00:02:31 -> 00:02:34] grita, comunicando que no,\n[00:02:34 -> 00:02:36] no percibe a ti.\n[00:02:36 -> 00:02:38] No hoy, en ningún caso.\n[00:02:38 -> 00:02:44] Al fondo de esta humilde,\n[00:02:46 -> 00:02:50] hovel de licor,\n[00:02:50 -> 00:02:55] hay una puerta rosa gruesa.\n[00:02:57 -> 00:02:59] Hay un montón de brasa.\n[00:02:59 -> 00:03:04] Es escondida detrás de una ventana,\n[00:03:04 -> 00:03:08] pero es más suave que cualquier otra cosa aquí.\n[00:03:10 -> 00:03:13] Seguido detrás de la ventana\n[00:03:13 -> 00:03:18] es una figura fina y rígida\n[00:03:19 -> 00:03:21] que se mira hacia ti.\n[00:03:26 -> 00:03:28] No hay mal.\n[00:03:28 -> 00:03:33] Empuja su mano hacia la cubierta de la puerta.\n[00:03:33 -> 00:03:35] Empuja su mano hacia la cubierta de la puerta.\n[00:03:35 -> 00:03:50] Algo pesado como piedras se agarra en una cintura oculta Se agarra en una cintura oculta La pared se abre y por un minuto\n[00:03:50 -> 00:03:55] supera el estrés de roca y de ala en el suelo.\n[00:03:58 -> 00:04:03] Incensos poderosos, algo pesado,\n[00:04:03 -> 00:04:06] de otro mundo, cuando pasas por las sombras.\n[00:04:06 -> 00:04:18] Entras en un lugar oculto de alegría detrás de Pottersfield.\n[00:04:18 -> 00:04:24] Te miras y ves a la propietaria, Devlin, mirar hacia ti.\n[00:04:25 -> 00:04:29] Ríos y ríos de botellas, cristal, glasware, por encima.\n[00:04:30 -> 00:04:33] Las rejillas aquí, brasa, vela,\n[00:04:33 -> 00:04:39] de un calibre más alto que el que reside en el exterior.\n[00:04:40 -> 00:04:41] Devlin,\n[00:04:43 -> 00:04:44] con una capa abrimada,\n[00:04:44 -> 00:04:45] se apunta hacia adelante para cubrir\n[00:04:45 -> 00:04:48] el topo de su cabello,\n[00:04:48 -> 00:04:49] se mira hacia ti.\n[00:04:50 -> 00:04:53] Sus ojos siempre reflejan\n[00:04:53 -> 00:04:55] un par de más campanas,\n[00:04:56 -> 00:04:58] un par de más lanternas\n[00:04:58 -> 00:05:01] que están presente en este espacio físico.\n[00:05:01 -> 00:05:04] espacio. Se levanta y dice,\n[00:05:07 -> 00:05:12] Maestro, un placer conocerte. ¿Puedo traerte algo de vino? ¿O solo estás aquí para un\n[00:05:12 -> 00:05:14] espejo?\n[00:05:14 -> 00:05:23] Oh. Ha sido una semana rara. Creo que un poco de algo interesante haría muy bien.\n[00:05:24 -> 00:05:26] Está siendo extraño ahí afuera.\n[00:05:26 -> 00:05:29] Si se mantiene,\n[00:05:29 -> 00:05:32] eventualmente se vuelve tan extraño como está aquí.\n[00:05:32 -> 00:05:34] Jajajaja.\n[00:05:34 -> 00:05:38] Le pide algo grueso y viscoso.\n[00:05:38 -> 00:05:42] Un aroma delicioso. Debe ser algo dulce.\n[00:05:42 -> 00:05:45] Sherry lo pone delante de ti.\n[00:05:48 -> 00:05:49] Se mira hacia un lado.\n[00:05:49 -> 00:05:52] Ves a una mujer\n[00:05:52 -> 00:05:56] usando ropas de ropa gruesa,\n[00:05:56 -> 00:05:58] una larga camisa.\n[00:05:58 -> 00:06:03] Usa un vestido sin forma ni forma,\n[00:06:03 -> 00:06:05] pero su cara es angular y hermosa.\n[00:06:05 -> 00:06:09] Se sienta en las paredes de vela,\n[00:06:09 -> 00:06:10] una lanterna de ornato,\n[00:06:10 -> 00:06:12] hecha de un deslizamiento, casi mosaico,\n[00:06:12 -> 00:06:13] como un vidrio,\n[00:06:13 -> 00:06:15] estampado en diferentes colores,\n[00:06:15 -> 00:06:18] iluminando su cara.\n[00:06:18 -> 00:06:20] Se apoya con empatía en sus ojos\n[00:06:20 -> 00:06:25] y comprensión a una madre y una hija\n[00:06:25 -> 00:06:28] a su alrededor que parecen\n[00:06:28 -> 00:06:31] aburridos en su insomnio.\n[00:06:31 -> 00:06:33] Dame un cheque de percepción.\n[00:06:36 -> 00:06:37] A ver.\n[00:06:40 -> 00:06:42] Va a ser un 19.\n[00:06:44 -> 00:06:47] Incluso con su tono gritado, tus oídos detectan...\n[00:06:47 -> 00:06:50] Por supuesto, por supuesto.\n[00:06:52 -> 00:06:57] Las preocupaciones son tan grandes como el problema que te llevó aquí en primer lugar.\n[00:06:59 -> 00:07:04] Tu padre, tu esposo, Soul, está en el mundo subterráneo.\n[00:07:05 -> 00:07:08] No hay un afterlife que le llame.\n[00:07:11 -> 00:07:15] Los clericos de la totalidad,\n[00:07:15 -> 00:07:19] quizás algunos druides del viejo camino\n[00:07:19 -> 00:07:21] buscara\n[00:07:23 -> 00:07:38] enviar su alma hacia el ablilio y el vac o quiz depicar alg camino sin ruta a trav de reinos m all que sab los Shapers pero si deseas\n[00:07:39 -> 00:07:42] un lugar de descansación más brillante\n[00:07:43 -> 00:07:45] para tu padre,\n[00:07:45 -> 00:07:47] y aquí ella hace contacto con la joven\n[00:07:47 -> 00:07:49] que, como puedes ver, probablemente no haya dormido días,\n[00:07:49 -> 00:07:51] las lágrimas se han secado\n[00:07:51 -> 00:07:53] en donde se le ha ido la cara.\n[00:07:53 -> 00:07:55] Ella dice,\n[00:07:55 -> 00:07:58] Hay pocos preciosos en este mundo que pueden ayudarte,\n[00:07:58 -> 00:08:00] pero hay algunos,\n[00:08:00 -> 00:08:05] hay algunos que desean que estas almas no se pierdan.\n[00:08:06 -> 00:08:09] Ahora, nuestro apoyo no viene barato,\n[00:08:09 -> 00:08:11] pero es confiable,\n[00:08:11 -> 00:08:14] y ves un contrato de vela\n[00:08:14 -> 00:08:16] movido a la mesa\n[00:08:16 -> 00:08:20] a la joven mujer que comienza a leer el texto.\n[00:08:20 -> 00:08:25] Alguien más le dice su nombre en este lugar.\n[00:08:26 -> 00:08:29] Volare, amigo.\n[00:08:29 -> 00:08:34] Vienes a ver a Rulius y a Calastro Merkanod.\n[00:08:37 -> 00:08:40] Ves que están sentados en un barrio privado.\n[00:08:41 -> 00:08:43] Uno de ellos ha movido las tarjetas de vela.\n[00:08:43 -> 00:08:47] Ves que hay un joven\n[00:08:47 -> 00:08:51] que está apagado por sus labios\n[00:08:51 -> 00:08:54] y ve que los ojos se han roto en su cabeza\n[00:08:54 -> 00:08:59] como si soñara en algún estado de narcotraficantes.\n[00:09:00 -> 00:09:01] Cuando Rulius habla,\n[00:09:01 -> 00:09:04] Calastro pone sus labios cerca de los oídos del jove